      "kind": "Property",
      "preferredName": "Manufacturer Business Partner Number",
      "description": "Business Partner Number (BPNL, BPNS or BPNA) of the manufacturer of the related product. Kept deliberately, although also available via the digital twin, to enable cross-referencing.",
